# aidd / agent-generated artifacts
# Root-anchored and blanket: this repository has a public push remote, so .aidd/ is local-only.
# The earlier per-row profile (ignore only the runtime/generated/secret rows, commit the blueprint)
# is the "managed" profile — correct only while a repository has NO push remote. This one acquired
# one, so the blueprint stops being publishable; see .githooks/aidd-history-guard.sh, which enforces
# exactly this and is the reason the tracked .aidd history was stripped rather than merely untracked.
# The files stay on disk and the aidd tooling keeps working; they are simply never published.
/.aidd/

